<view class="acceptance-entry">
  <view class="entry-copy">
    <text class="entry-eyebrow">费曼验收</text>
    <text class="entry-title">用自己的话讲清楚</text>
    <text class="entry-detail">完成课程后，通过复述来整理本次知识点。AI 只会提供候选证据，最终结论由老师核验。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="entry-checks" wx:if="{{!acceptanceId}}">
    <view class="entry-check"><text class="entry-check__mark">1</text><text>开始后将申请麦克风权限</text></view>
    <view class="entry-check"><text class="entry-check__mark">2</text><text>原始语音仅用于本次验收与老师核验</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="state-panel" wx:if="{{unavailable}}">
    <text class="state-panel__title">验收课程信息缺失</text>
    <button class="state-panel__action pressable" bindtap="goBack">返回学习页</button>
  </view>
  <button wx:elif="{{!acceptanceId}}" class="entry-action pressable" loading="{{preparing}}" disabled="{{preparing}}" bindtap="prepareAcceptance">准备录音</button>
  <view wx:else class="recording-panel">
    <text class="recording-panel__title">请开始讲解本次知识点</text>
    <text class="recording-panel__copy">讲清概念、步骤和原因。提交后会进入老师核验流程。</text>
    <button wx:if="{{!recording}}" class="entry-action pressable" loading="{{uploading}}" disabled="{{uploading}}" bindtap="startRecording">开始录音</button>
    <button wx:else class="stop-action pressable" bindtap="stopRecording">结束并上传</button>
  </view>
</view>
